            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Canh Cua",
            "review_text": "ĐỖ ĐỨC TÀI\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam19 contributions\n1\nThe best crab restaurant in Saigon\nJan 2024 • Family\nThis restaurant is quite clean and has many delicious dishes specializing in Ca Mau crab. Menus in Vietnamese, English, Korean and Japanese are very suitable for diners. We chose 3 crabs weighing nearly 3.2kg for 3 dishes with garlic butter sauce, chili sauce and roasted pepper. The 3 dishes were very delicious and flavorful, the crabs were very firm and fragrant. The service people are very enthusiastic and cute.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten February 3, 2024",
